            <div xml:id="d503">

                <pb facs="0614" n="526" sameAs="frus:frus1933v05/pg526"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.01/55</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Assistant Secretary of State</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-11-25">November 25, 1933</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Chilean Ambassador, Señor Don Manuel Trucco, came to see me twice recently,
                    on Thursday and Friday. He was very vague as to exactly what he wanted on
                    Thursday, but on Friday he came out with it. His Government wants to know what
                    would be our attitude I if various Latin American countries decided to recognize
                    the Grau San Martín Government before the Montevideo Conference convenes.</p>
                <closer><signed>J[<hi rendition="#small-caps">efferson</hi>] C[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">affery</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
